Yep, that error was from our upload request shape. Slack’s upload methods are valid, but `files.getUploadURLExternal` is fussy in practice; I changed the workflow calls from JSON bodies to `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`, and `completeUploadExternal` now form-posts the `files` array as a JSON string. I also made the error output include Slack’s `response_metadata.messages` next time.

